dsh-context-usage-guard README · The percentage is one pixel larger than the figures beside it：The same footer band holds the session statistics and the ring, and the two
shipped stylesheets disagree by one pixel about how big a figure is:

```css
/* @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-chat — StatsPills.module.css, the pills */
.Q51KRG_trigger { font-size: calc(var(--dsh-content-font-size-secondary,13px) - 1px) }

/* @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation — ContextMeter.module.css, the ring */

dsh-context-usage-guard README · Browser half: one stylesheet rule：The browser half adds one stylesheet rule that repeats the statistics
declaration verbatim:

```css
button[aria-haspopup="dialog"]:has(> svg > circle) {
  font-size: calc(var(--dsh-content-font-size-secondary,13px) - 1px);
}
```

dsh-context-usage-guard README · 百分比比旁边的数字大一个像素：同一条 footer 区里既有会话统计、也有这个环，而两份随包样式表对「一个数字画多大」
的判断差了一个像素：

```css
/* @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-chat — StatsPills.module.css, the pills */
.bOPqQW_root    { font-size: calc(var(--dsh-content-font-size-secondary,13px) - 1px) }

/* @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation — ContextMeter.module.css, the ring */

两个前缀都是按构建内容哈希出来的——上面这一对是这里安装到的 `0.2.1-rc.5` 包所带的；
真正要紧的是那两条*声明*，`test/meter-typography.spec.ts` 会从已安装的包里重新读
它们，而不是相信这段引文。

dsh-context-usage-guard README · 浏览器侧：一条样式规则：浏览器侧新增一条样式规则，逐字复述统计胶囊的那条声明：

```css
button[aria-haspopup="dialog"]:has(> svg > circle) {
  font-size: calc(var(--dsh-content-font-size-secondary,13px) - 1px);
}
```
